    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24686" root="صلب" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُلَّبٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُلْبٌ</span>, former half, in two places.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>A hard stone,</i> the <i>hardest of stones.</i>
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>Whetstones;</i> (S, M, K, TA;) as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُلَّبَةٌ</span></b>  (TA) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُلَّبِىٌّ</span></b>  (M, K, TA;) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُلَّبِيَّةٌ</span></b> : (S, M, K, TA:) [or <i>a whetstone:</i>] or [<i>a
thing</i>] <i>like a whetstone.</i> (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُلَّبِىٌّ</span>.

